169	## 8. Production rules (the bridge draws nothing if you break them)
170	
171	- Every model needs a same-origin URL or pathname and a 64-character `sha256`; the production bridge accepts only `createAssetProvenance(node.asset).source === "typed-aura-assets-manifest"`. An http(s) URL, a missing hash or an unhashed duplicate under `apps/<route>/public/aura-assets/` makes the scene draw nothing (`drawCalls` 0).
172	- `?models=0` switches `defineModelAssets` to the procedural fallback; keep a fallback only if loading can fail, and log a diagnostic when it triggers.
